@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Ott Based System Mini Reel

state Start
state LoggedOut
state WatchVideos
state UploadVideo
state SaveVideo
state ViewSavedVideos
state EnterDiscussion
state BlogsNewsUpdates
state AccountCreation
state IncorrectDetails
state SignIn
state NewCase
state CaseCategorySelection
state CaseDetailEntry
state SetReminder
state UploadDocuments
state LoginAttemptInvalid
state PublishedArticles
state SearchArticles
state ReadArticle
state ProvideFeedback
state LoggedIn

AccountCreation --* LoggedOut: Create Account
LoggedOut --> SignIn
SignIn --* LoggedOut: Sign In
LoggedIn --> WatchVideos
WatchVideos --> SaveVideo
SaveVideo --> ViewSavedVideos
ViewSavedVideos --> EnterDiscussion
BlogsNewsUpdates --* LoggedIn: Explore Blogs and News Updates
EnterDiscussion --> EnterDiscussion: Enter Discussion Option

AccountCreation --> IncorrectDetails: Provided Incorrect Details
SignIn --> LoginAttemptInvalid: Invalid Login Attempt

NewCase --* LoggedIn: Add a New Case
NewCase --> CaseCategorySelection
CaseCategorySelection --> CaseDetailEntry
CaseDetailEntry --> SetReminder
SetReminder --> UploadDocuments
UploadDocuments --> LoggedIn

@enduml
